# Private / local-only — MUST stay out of the .vsix (these get attached to public
# GitHub releases). vsce reads THIS file, not .gitignore, so list them here too.
plan.json
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
.gitignore

# Machine-local launcher glue and its output — absolute paths for one device.
